# README.md
# AI Data Analyst

A complete data analysis dashboard built with Python and Streamlit. It helps users upload CSV or Excel files, review data quality, generate summary insights, and ask simple questions about a dataset.

## Features

- Upload CSV or Excel files
- Dataset preview and summary metrics
- Missing value and duplicate detection
- Sales, profit, and trend visualizations
- Rule-based Q&A for common data questions
- Exportable report generation

## Tech Stack

- Python 3.10+
- Streamlit
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Plotly
- OpenPyXL

## Project Structure

