These images can be used in your achievement section, GitHub profile, or portfolio.

## Example Questions

- What is the top sales region?
- Which product has the highest sales?
- Are there missing values?
- Give me a summary of the dataset.
- Show the sales trend over time.

## Submission Ready

This project is structured as a practical analytics portfolio project and is suitable for GitHub showcases, school submissions, and professional demos.
